    {
      "name": "Menu",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Create Menu Item",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test(\"Status code is 201\", function () {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(201);",
                  "});",
                  "",
                  "pm.test(\"Response has correct name\", function () {",
                  "    const jsonData = pm.response.json();",
                  "    pm.expect(jsonData.name).to.eql(\"Latte\");",
                  "});",
                  "",
                  "pm.test(\"Price matches what was sent\", function () {",
                  "    const jsonData = pm.response.json();",
                  "    pm.expect(jsonData.price).to.eql(\"4.50\");",
                  "});",
                  "",
                  "pm.test(\"Item is marked available\", function () {",
                  "    const jsonData = pm.response.json();",
                  "    pm.expect(jsonData.isAvailable).to.eql(true);",
                  "});",
                  "",
                  "if (pm.response.code === 201) {",
                  "    const jsonData = pm.response.json();",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set(\"lastCategory\", jsonData.partitionKey);",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set(\"lastId\", jsonData.rowKey);",
                  "}"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "packages": {},
                "requests": {}
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"category\": \"Coffee\",\n  \"id\": \"latte01\",\n  \"name\": \"Latte\",\n  \"description\": \"Espresso with steamed milk\",\n  \"price\": \"4.50\",\n  \"isAvailable\": true\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/menu",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "menu"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Creates a new menu item. Fails if `category` + `id` already exists.\n\nHeaders: `Content-Type: application/json`\n\nBody:\n\njson\n\n``` json\n{\n  \"category\": \"Coffee\",\n  \"id\": \"latte01\",\n  \"name\": \"Latte\",\n  \"description\": \"Espresso with steamed milk\",\n  \"price\": \"4.50\",\n  \"isAvailable\": true\n}\n\n ```\n\n| Field | Type | Rules |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| category | string | required, 2–100 chars |\n| id | string | required, 2–50 chars |\n| name | string | required, 2–100 chars |\n| description | string | required, 5–500 chars |\n| price | string | required, 2-10 chars |\n| isAvailable | bool | required |\n\nResponses:\n\n· `201` created, returns `MenuItem` (price is a **string**, e.g. `\"4.50\"`)\n\n· `400` validation failed / malformed JSON\n\n· `409` category+id already exists"
          },
          "response": []
        },
